{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/884186-supernatural-creatures-project","id":884186,"title":"Supernatural Creatures Project","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-06T17:44:48-07:00","id":884186,"title":"Supernatural Creatures Project","content":"Retracted Statement","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11693,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 02-13-2019, 08:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T18:18:23-07:00","id":884218,"title":"","content":"Well I think I need to know a little bit more before I can give any worthwhile advice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T18:28:23-07:00","id":884223,"title":"","content":"What makes it different from all the others on the market? When you have two Worlds of Darkness eating up a lot of ground, the Dresden Files as a pretty major share of the market as well, and numerous others just within tabletop stuff (Unknown Armies, Delta Green, Urban Shadows, Monsterhearts), to say nothing of the countless stuff on TV and in comic books. At the risk of sounding callous, you need something profoundly distinct to make it worth a reader's time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions"